   "start": 16.7,
   "speechStart": 16.7,
   "end": 22.425,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "From it, read the course to steer that holds you on the new line, and your speed made good along it."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 22.675,
   "speechStart": 22.675,
   "end": 29.525,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Convert that course to compass for the helmsman, using the variation, and the deviation for the new heading."
